        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.03,
          "end": 38,
          "en": "as I did it before in these other functions as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38,
          "end": 40.96,
          "en": "And then the promise will be returned by this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.96,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "And to this promise be passed is inner function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 46.69,
          "en": "which gets the resolve and reject functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.69,
          "end": 50.85,
          "en": "And in this inner function, we now write our database code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.85,
          "end": 53.62,
          "en": "We will again work on the same database as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.62,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "and start a new transaction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.8,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "And hence as before we get this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "where we get the transaction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.84,
          "end": 62.62,
          "en": "where we can then execute a SQL command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.62,
          "end": 65.44,
          "en": "That's exactly the same approach as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.44,
          "end": 67.773,
          "en": "in all those other helper functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.28,
          "end": 71.44,
          "en": "Now, the SQL command I wanna execute here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.44,
          "end": 73.22,
          "en": "is a super simple one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.22,
          "end": 75.25,
          "en": "I just want to select everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.25,
          "end": 78.47,
          "en": "from the places table like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.47,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "that's all, that is the entire function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 85.36,
          "en": "Off course, you could add WHERE clauses and filter the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.36,
          "end": 88.78,
          "en": "You could also add ORDER BY and order the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.78,
          "end": 92.41,
          "en": "all these standard clauses, which you know from SQL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.41,
          "end": 95.93,
          "en": "for example, from our SQL course if you wanna learn that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.93,
          "end": 98.22,
          "en": "All these standard clauses work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 100.67,
          "en": "but here I just wanna get all the places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.67,
          "end": 103.21000000000001,
          "en": "without any filters, without any special order.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.21000000000001,
          "end": 106.49000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, this query will do the trick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.49000000000001,
          "end": 109.66,
          "en": "Now, besides this query we still pass a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.66,
          "end": 112.95,
          "en": "to execute SQL as well which is this array of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.95,
          "end": 115.38,
          "en": "that should be injected into this command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.38,
          "end": 117.66,
          "en": "But here we don't have any placeholders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 122.15,
          "en": "so no data should be injected, hence it's an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.15,
          "end": 126.4,
          "en": "And then we have the success and the error functions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.4,
          "end": 129.93,
          "en": "And in the success case, I ignore the transaction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 131.81,
          "en": "but I'm interested in the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.81,
          "end": 135.14,
          "en": "because that should give us all our places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.14,
          "end": 138.23,
          "en": "In the error case, I will accept the error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.23,
          "end": 141.57999999999998,
          "en": "And in the error case, I wanna reject my error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.57999999999998,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "In the success case, I want to resolve my result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.12,
          "end": 149.34,
          "en": "And I wanna look into my result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.34,
          "end": 151.97,
          "en": "so that we understand what we're getting back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.97,
          "end": 155.19299999999998,
          "en": "so that we know how we can work with that result later on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.05,
          "end": 158.94,
          "en": "And that's the fetchPlaces helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.94,
          "end": 160.89,
          "en": "now we can call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.89,
          "end": 163.01,
