          "id": 125,
          "start": 374.34,
          "end": 376.3,
          "en": "of this array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 376.3,
          "end": 379.16,
          "en": "So I will cut this and insert it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 379.16,
          "end": 381.86,
          "en": "And every data point basically is a place",
